        "description": "Implement a penalty-based objective function that minimizes negative sum of radii plus large penalties for constraint violations (overlaps and out-of-bounds). Use scipy.optimize.differential_evolution to search the 78-dimensional space (26 centers \u00d7 2 coordinates + 26 radii). The DE method is ideal for this non-convex problem as it can escape local minima. Set bounds: centers in [0,1]\u00d7[0,1], radii in [0,0.5]. Use penalty coefficients that scale with violation severity. Run with multiple workers and high maxiter for thorough search. This replaces the fixed grid with a global search that can discover irregular optimal patterns.",
